Adds repo.kind 'server' backed by the TeamAI management backend (issue #341):
device-flow login, project binding, full-snapshot pull with content by hash
and 304, push/remove as change sets, contribute as a learning, usage/vote/
session reports over HTTP. No git anywhere on the member's machine.
